{"source_term":"父冑","lineage":"paternal"},"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-064","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete-ws2263487","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete:p001","quote":"　　滕胤字承嗣，北海劇人也。伯父耽，父冑，與劉繇州裡通家。以世擾亂，渡江依繇。孫權為車騎將軍，拜耽右司馬，以寬厚稱，早卒，無嗣。冑善屬文，權待以賓禮，軍國書疏，常令損益潤色之，亦不幸短命。權為吳王，迫錄舊恩，封胤都亭侯。少有節操，美容儀。弱冠尚公主。年三十，起家為丹楊太守，徙吳郡、會稽，所在見稱。太元元年，權寢疾，詣都，留為太常；與諾葛恪等俱受遺詔輔政。孫亮即位，加衛將軍。","subject_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete:p001:m0002","object_person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete:p001:m0019"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"卷六十四具名為父冑。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"family_tree_policy":{"default":"editorial_preferred","original_assertions_preserved":true,"unreviewed_conflicts_may_remain":true,"runtime_ai_required":false},"family_paths":[],"life_events":[{"id":"le-wu064-tengz-death","person_id":"vcx_xzo_9bw","event_type":"death","source_term":"短命","source_anchor":{"paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete:p001","start":91,"end":93,"surface":"短命"},"date_expression":null,"evidence":[{"work_id":"w-sanguozhi","book_id":"b-sanguozhi-064","chapter_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete","source_id":"s-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete-ws2263487","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete:p001","quote":"　　滕胤字承嗣，北海劇人也。伯父耽，父冑，與劉繇州裡通家。以世擾亂，渡江依繇。孫權為車騎將軍，拜耽右司馬，以寬厚稱，早卒，無嗣。冑善屬文，權待以賓禮，軍國書疏，常令損益潤色之，亦不幸短命。權為吳王，迫錄舊恩，封胤都亭侯。少有節操，美容儀。弱冠尚公主。年三十，起家為丹楊太守，徙吳郡、會稽，所在見稱。太元元年，權寢疾，詣都，留為太常；與諾葛恪等俱受遺詔輔政。孫亮即位，加衛將軍。","person_mention_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete:p001:m0019"}],"status":"source_attested","interpretation_note":"按同段人物與次第核所屬卒事。","reviewer":"Codex（AI代理）","model":null,"human_reviewed":false}],"mentions":[{"id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complete:p001:m0019","surface":"冑","start":19,"end":20,"kind":"person","person_id":"vcx_xzo_9bw","status":"contextual_provisional","paragraph_id":"c-sanguozhi-064-tengyin-complet